1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Open AI Library Studio to start creating an image.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
The media library contains reusable images and saved assets.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Browse the available pose collection and choose a pose for the model.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Next, open the costume picker and browse the available outfits.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,000
Select a pose and a costume to configure the image.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Add a model image, then provide any additional scene instructions.

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The prompt describes the intended result: make the pose of the image with the dress.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
The selected pose and costume are shown in the generation setup.

9
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Submit the request and wait while the image is generated.

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The generation completes, producing one image with the selected pose and costume.

11
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Review the generated result in the Studio.

12
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,600
Open the generated images panel to view the saved output.
